# Committed on purpose. This is Supabase's *publishable* key -- it is
# designed to be visible in the browser (Astro's PUBLIC_ prefix ships it
# into client bundles). All real protection is Postgres Row Level Security
# on the tried_entries table plus Supabase Auth, not the secrecy of this
# value. See supabase/README.md before changing anything here.
#
# Never put the Supabase service_role key or a GitHub token in this file --
# those go in .env.local, which is gitignored.
